--
--   **Context.** CRT reversal §8: phase 2 by additive swaps (`p2E`) and the reversal `revE = p1U; p2E; p3U`
--
--   `p2E` replaces KFUU's `p2U` (`⌊n/2⌋` single-digit swaps, cost `n·h^τ`) by the nine-phase word of
--   `mainU` (three composite swaps of `u·⌊n/2⌋`-bit digits and six rotation sets). **`p2E_runs`** has
--   the interface of `p2U_runs` (with `SwOKτ τ` and `2 ≤ n`); **`revE_runs`** / **`revKE`** the
